{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121074224038-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121115616\"/><p>仵工到場將遺體舁送殮房。</p><p>今日(21日)早上7時33分，深水埗南昌街公廁職員報案，指懷疑一名男子在上址暈倒。人員接報到場，消防破門而入，男子現場被證實死亡，36歲尼泊爾籍事主死因有待驗屍後確定。警員將案件列作「屍體發現」，稍後召仵工到場將遺體舁送殮房。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:03:47.543166+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:42:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T05:17:26.655160+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:23.769020+00:00","content_hash":"808e43afa956771d36e150870d9480d1a5355539b760e3208da1126c6801a038","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}